cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article below."
title: "Stage-3 Dosage-Aware Genomic Selection Pipeline for Hexaploid Sweetpotato: Simulation-Validated Reference Implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference R implementation of the Stage-3 pilot dosage-aware genomic-selection pipeline described
  in Table 5 (Section 7) of the associated article: dosage-uncertain genotype calling with polyRAD,
  hexaploid additive genomic relationship-matrix construction with AGHmatrix, dosage-aware GBLUP
  with sommer across five target traits under five-fold cross-validation, an MGIDI Stage-1 classical
  baseline matched to the same trait scope, and the bootstrap confidence-interval gate test that
  compares them. Validated end to end on a simulated 315-progeny biparental hexaploid population;
  only the data-loading step needs to change once real genotyping data becomes available.
